%N A400244 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = A(x^3/(1 - x)^4) / (1 - x)^2, with A(0) = 1.
%F A400244 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=0..floor(n/3)} binomial(n+k+1,4*k+1) * a(k).
%F A400244 G.f.: B(x)^2 where B(x) is the g.f. of A400242.
%o A400244 (PARI) a_vector(n) = my(v=vector(n+1)); v[1]=1; for(i=1, n, v[i+1]=sum(j=0, i\3, binomial(i+j+1, 4*j+1)*v[j+1])); v;
%Y A400244 Cf. A400242, A400246.
